 "engenn4le18ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kitchen"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place where you prepare food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need more experience in the kitchen."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to meet "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reach; to succeed in doing something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a lot of deadlines to meet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of your ideal job. What kind of job is it?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find information about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph (8-10 lines) to describe the job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say why you would love to have this job."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Read your paragraph to your partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's paragraph and exchange advice."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify online about jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe jobs and work in a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express my feelings about my ideal job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give advice to a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}